          %title Contents
          %hr/
          %p
            This entry discusses the general notion of a
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+functor"} derived functor
            specified to the special context of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homological+algebra"} homological algebra
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categories+of+chain+complexes"} categories of chain complexes
          %p
            In the literature, this is often understood to be the default case of derived functors. For more discussion of how the following relates to the more general concepts of derived functors, see
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a{:href => "derived+functor#InHomologicalAlgebra"} derived functor – In homological algebra
