          %p
            For proving the basic property of derived functors below in prop.
            = succeed "," do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LongExactSequenceOfRightDerivedFunctorsFromShortExactSequence"}
          #ProjectiveResolutionOfExactSequenceByExactSequence.num_lemma
            %h6#lemma Lemma
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn 0
