              is left exact. The other case works dually. The first condition of def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FInjectives"}
              is satisfied because every
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/injective+object"} injective object
              is an
              = succeed "-" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
